  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまと　しっぽの　２つの　のうはがどうきしたことで　エスパーパワーはキリンリキの　１０ばい　アップした。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리와 꼬리 2개의 뇌파가 동기화하여 에스퍼 파워가 키링키의 10배로 강화되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "透過同步頭部和尾巴的腦波，使得牠的超能力提升到了有麒麟奇的１０倍之高。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Grâce à la synchronisation des ondes cérébrales de sa tête et de sa queue, ses pouvoirs psychiques sont dix fois plus puissants que ceux de Girafarig.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aufgrund der synchronisierten Gehirnströme von Kopf und Schweif sind seine Psycho-Kräfte zehnmal so stark wie die von Girafarig.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las ondas cerebrales de la cola y la cabeza van al compás, lo que le confiere poderes psíquicos diez veces más potentes que los de los Girafarig.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le onde cerebrali della testa e della coda si sono sincronizzate, rendendo i suoi poteri psichici dieci volte superiori a quelli dei Girafarig.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Now that the brain waves from the head and tail are synced up, the psychic power of this Pokémon is 10 times stronger than Girafarig’s.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭と　尻尾の　２つの　脳波が同期したことで　エスパーパワーはキリンリキの　１０倍　アップした。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "通过同步头部和尾巴的脑波，来让自己的超能力提升到了麒麟奇的１０倍之高。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las ondas cerebrales de la cola y la cabeza van al compás, lo que le confiere poderes psíquicos diez veces más potentes que los de los Girafarig.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かたい　テールヘッドで　ほんたいの　あたまをまもりつつ　ながい　くびを　ふりまわしてずつきを　くらわせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "단단한 테일 헤드로 본체의 머리를 보호하면서 긴 목을 휘둘러 박치기를 먹여 준다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用堅硬的尾巴頭保護著本體的頭，並揮甩長長的脖子讓對手吃牠一記頭錘。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il fait tournoyer son cou pour frapper ses adversaires, il protège sa tête principale à l’aide de sa tête noire, qui est plus dure.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Während es seinen langen Hals umherschwingt und damit Stöße austeilt, wird sein Hauptkopf vom harten Schweifkopf geschützt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La dura cabeza de la cola protege a la principal cuando agita su largo cuello para propinar cabezazos a sus enemigos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Protegge la testa principale con quella più dura della coda e fa roteare il lungo collo per tirare potenti testate.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The hardened head from the tail protects the head of the main body as Farigiraf whips its long neck around to headbutt enemies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "硬い　テールヘッドで　本体の　頭を守りつつ　長い　首を　振りまわして頭突きを　食らわせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
